<title>USA: Prime Retail Inc shr loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Prime Retail Inc shr loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr  loss		  $0.05     loss	  $0.25</p>
<p> Net  loss		    635     loss	   714</p>
<p> Revs			21,831		   20,005</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,322		    2,875</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.17     loss	  $0.74</p>
<p> Net loss		   7,573     loss	 2,120</p>
<p> Revs			63,112		   56,069</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,481		    2,875</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) NOTE: Funds from operations in Q3 1996 were $0.29/shr primary, and $0.31/shr fully diluted, vs $0.15/shr primary and $0.27/shr fully diluted in the prior-yr period.</p>
<p>Net loss is after allocations to preferred shareholders. Net income before this allocation is $2.3 million in Q3 1996, and $4.5 million in Q3 1995.</p>
<p>Results for 1996 9-month period include an extraordinary loss of $0.16/shr from early extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>---New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
